    <p>
        For any component that may conceptually have 3 layers like a sandwich, I call each of these layers a 'Pane'.
        I found having these 3 conceptual layers made it easier to reason when creating and setting variables. Especially when you have say a hole cut out of the surface to expose
        a panel or further down to the base.
    </p>
    
    <p>Base, the first pane.</p>
    
